# Architecture

Read `architecture/SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md` and `architecture/MODULE_REGISTRY.md` before structural changes.

- VYMOD is consumer-facing; Core interfaces are versioned and explicit (`architecture/integrations/`).
- Document substantive decisions in `architecture/decisions/`.
- No unrestricted cross-product data access.
- P0: integration **documentation only**, not live DIMO/SYNQDRIVE wiring.

Owners in MODULE_REGISTRY must approve boundary changes.
